{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1619920/extras/ecd49ab4734f8eec029560c4c05cf004.avif?t=1743782439\" width=600 height=202 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1619920/extras/716e553c38075e68e0f885e08609053f.poster.avif?t=1743782439\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1619920/extras/716e553c38075e68e0f885e08609053f.webm?t=1743782439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1619920/extras/716e553c38075e68e0f885e08609053f.mp4?t=1743782439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1619920/extras/69c65ed2356f8b4df9148222120d5dff.avif?t=1743782439\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Path of Ren is a challenging precision platformer with tight, expressive controls. Run, jump, climb, swing, and master orb abilities to conquer 300+ unique challenges!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master Orb Abilities</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Orb abilities are easy to learn, but difficult to master! Use them to dash, crystalize, ghostify, warp, and slow time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1619920/extras/bde1a74dc72281b7838a98e0c1c1e586.poster.avif?t=1743782439\" width=600 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1619920/extras/bde1a74dc72281b7838a98e0c1c1e586.webm?t=1743782439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Collecting an orb lets you use that ability a single time with the press or hold of a button.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1619920/extras/c7aa5d51ef5505bc61a84210fabfbdbc.poster.avif?t=1743782439\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1619920/extras/c7aa5d51ef5505bc61a84210fabfbdbc.webm?t=1743782439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1619920/extras/c7aa5d51ef5505bc61a84210fabfbdbc.mp4?t=1743782439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect Journal Entries</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect thought-provoking journal entries scattered throughout the world. While entirely optional, they may give you a different perspective about the world of Mythoria.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1619920/extras/75f15757b4e43f34316adbd00ff45788.poster.avif?t=1743782439\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1619920/extras/75f15757b4e43f34316adbd00ff45788.webm?t=1743782439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1619920/extras/75f15757b4e43f34316adbd00ff45788.mp4?t=1743782439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Conquer Timed Trials</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your skills by replaying the levels from story mode with time and point targets. Achieve bronze, silver, and gold medals and rank on <strong>Steam Leaderboards</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1619920/extras/d16e370acf4d996bfea1f6abd21dbb08.poster.avif?t=1743782439\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1619920/extras/d16e370acf4d996bfea1f6abd21dbb08.webm?t=1743782439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1619920/extras/d16e370acf4d996bfea1f6abd21dbb08.mp4?t=1743782439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock Outfits and Customize Ren</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock outfits and customize Ren to your own preferred style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1619920/extras/243066e1b77da5f2e170cb87b02086ff.poster.avif?t=1743782439\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1619920/extras/243066e1b77da5f2e170cb87b02086ff.webm?t=1743782439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1619920/extras/243066e1b77da5f2e170cb87b02086ff.mp4?t=1743782439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Story About a Wish</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A boy awakens in an unfamiliar world with only a single memory - a white fox granting him a forgotten wish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adventure through the world of Mythoria and help the boy rediscover what he wished for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1619920/extras/5d9719c9a1731089c15b29ced227c429.webp?t=1743782439\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1619920/extras/5d9719c9a1731089c15b29ced227c429.poster.avif?t=1743782439\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=120 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1619920/extras/5d81f9b21b0abb846893f81ca72a32e1.avif?t=1743782439\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Precision platformer with tight, expressive controls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mostly linear progression with side challenges and secret areas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >300+ unique platforming challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50 thought-provoking page journal entries to collect.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Timed Trials, where you can  replay previous sections with time and point targets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock outfits and customize the player to your own style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RPG elements &amp; story (skippable if desired).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assist mode to lower difficulty through customizable options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extremely challenging, but equally rewarding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1619920/extras/8b83295a0395fa28ca52f889f3d96126.avif?t=1743782439\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Try the FREE DEMO</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The best way to determine this is to try the <strong>FREE DEMO</strong> which is currently available!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Other Considerations / Checklist</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to playing the demo, here's a short checklist to help you determine if this game fits your taste. This game isn't for everyone, and as such, we want to do our best to ensure you understand what you're buying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you answer <u><strong>YES</strong></u> to most of the below, we believe you'll enjoy The Path of Ren.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you enjoy games where you die <u>a lot</u>, learn from those deaths, and eventually prevail? (Souls-like, etc..)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you played and enjoyed other popular precision platformers? (Celeste, Super Meat Boy, Rayman, etc..)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you enjoy single-player games created by a single person / small team?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you enjoy exploring hand-crafted, pixel art environments?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you like music that's designed to help you focus? (Lo-Fi, etc..)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1619920/extras/ba3e387fd6ee03a09edf6d846a6bfada.avif?t=1743782439\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Thank you so much!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Precision platformer games have always held a special place in my heart, so it\u2019s an incredible honor to contribute to a genre I love through this project.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a solo-developer, all of the support I've received throughout the journey of creating this has meant a lot. Whether you\u2019ve followed the game\u2019s development, helped shape it through testing, or are just now diving in, I\u2019m deeply grateful. Thank you so much! \ud83d\udc99</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1619920/extras/6dfc81e37cf2c9d7bbb0c803dc936840.avif?t=1743782439\" width=600 height=202 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Learning the Hard Way","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1619920/6269f1bb5463c031eae4d06cfd28779dd3758e9a.jpg"},{"name":"A Glutton for Punishment","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1619920/441e88ed21b1911c7bc49fe74e56e4ce5c3a9c40.jpg"},{"name":"Persistence is Key","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1619920/7ffae81522816c1ba2e79818fc28c9c43d389324.jpg"},{"name":"No Pain, No Gain","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1619920/fededc9a8c948c830f65c54130e63f6a9b7acf01.jpg"},{"name":"Death Will Not Stop Me","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1619920/f1f03ca92cf3ae08eb930daaa6f01aef649888d9.jpg"},{"name":"Page Journal Hobbyist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1619920/70d48528a01bb18308a550e563d8afc3959327a2.jpg"},{"name":"Page Journal Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1619920/b2c18ac8918cb9024608f0277afe026cc82de68b.jpg"},{"name":"Page Journal Connoisseur","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1619920/08cc01e62d36ab4b943d5aa8b5ab8f532d08fdc6.jpg"},{"name":"Page Journal Completionist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1619920/ac37d3009005cd7bd5ae20345f158886687edccb.jpg"},{"name":"The Path of the Purple Butterfly","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1619920/0bc311a732b593f87b19dedf351c52515fdb685f.jpg"}],"total":41},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1619920?t=1743782439","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1619920/ed0e216f72be628b4e17186edc48e1ea66d00f85/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743782439","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1619920/e43d0c216d667c928e89b0bf1271eb80d3a0d8c0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743782439","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1619920/e43d0c216d667c928e89b0bf1271eb80d3a0d8c0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743782439","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3272220,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1619920/extras/ecd49ab4734f8eec029560c4c05cf004.avif?t=1743782439\" width=600 height=202 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1619920/extras/716e553c38075e68e0f885e08609053f.poster.avif?t=1743782439\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1619920/extras/716e553c38075e68e0f885e08609053f.webm?t=1743782439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1619920/extras/716e553c38075e68e0f885e08609053f.mp4?t=1743782439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1619920/extras/69c65ed2356f8b4df9148222120d5dff.avif?t=1743782439\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Path of Ren is a challenging precision platformer with tight, expressive controls. Run, jump, climb, swing, and master orb abilities to conquer 300+ unique challenges!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master Orb Abilities</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Orb abilities are easy to learn, but difficult to master! Use them to dash, crystalize, ghostify, warp, and slow time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1619920/extras/bde1a74dc72281b7838a98e0c1c1e586.poster.avif?t=1743782439\" width=600 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1619920/extras/bde1a74dc72281b7838a98e0c1c1e586.webm?t=1743782439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Collecting an orb lets you use that ability a single time with the press or hold of a button.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1619920/extras/c7aa5d51ef5505bc61a84210fabfbdbc.poster.avif?t=1743782439\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1619920/extras/c7aa5d51ef5505bc61a84210fabfbdbc.webm?t=1743782439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1619920/extras/c7aa5d51ef5505bc61a84210fabfbdbc.mp4?t=1743782439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect Journal Entries</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect thought-provoking journal entries scattered throughout the world. While entirely optional, they may give you a different perspective about the world of Mythoria.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1619920/extras/75f15757b4e43f34316adbd00ff45788.poster.avif?t=1743782439\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1619920/extras/75f15757b4e43f34316adbd00ff45788.webm?t=1743782439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1619920/extras/75f15757b4e43f34316adbd00ff45788.mp4?t=1743782439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Conquer Timed Trials</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your skills by replaying the levels from story mode with time and point targets. Achieve bronze, silver, and gold medals and rank on <strong>Steam Leaderboards</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1619920/extras/d16e370acf4d996bfea1f6abd21dbb08.poster.avif?t=1743782439\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1619920/extras/d16e370acf4d996bfea1f6abd21dbb08.webm?t=1743782439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1619920/extras/d16e370acf4d996bfea1f6abd21dbb08.mp4?t=1743782439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock Outfits and Customize Ren</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock outfits and customize Ren to your own preferred style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1619920/extras/243066e1b77da5f2e170cb87b02086ff.poster.avif?t=1743782439\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1619920/extras/243066e1b77da5f2e170cb87b02086ff.webm?t=1743782439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1619920/extras/243066e1b77da5f2e170cb87b02086ff.mp4?t=1743782439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Story About a Wish</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A boy awakens in an unfamiliar world with only a single memory - a white fox granting him a forgotten wish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adventure through the world of Mythoria and help the boy rediscover what he wished for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1619920/extras/5d9719c9a1731089c15b29ced227c429.webp?t=1743782439\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1619920/extras/5d9719c9a1731089c15b29ced227c429.poster.avif?t=1743782439\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=120 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1619920/extras/5d81f9b21b0abb846893f81ca72a32e1.avif?t=1743782439\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Precision platformer with tight, expressive controls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mostly linear progression with side challenges and secret areas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >300+ unique platforming challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50 thought-provoking page journal entries to collect.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Timed Trials, where you can  replay previous sections with time and point targets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock outfits and customize the player to your own style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RPG elements &amp; story (skippable if desired).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assist mode to lower difficulty through customizable options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extremely challenging, but equally rewarding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1619920/extras/8b83295a0395fa28ca52f889f3d96126.avif?t=1743782439\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Try the FREE DEMO</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The best way to determine this is to try the <strong>FREE DEMO</strong> which is currently available!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Other Considerations / Checklist</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to playing the demo, here's a short checklist to help you determine if this game fits your taste. This game isn't for everyone, and as such, we want to do our best to ensure you understand what you're buying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you answer <u><strong>YES</strong></u> to most of the below, we believe you'll enjoy The Path of Ren.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you enjoy games where you die <u>a lot</u>, learn from those deaths, and eventually prevail? (Souls-like, etc..)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you played and enjoyed other popular precision platformers? (Celeste, Super Meat Boy, Rayman, etc..)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you enjoy single-player games created by a single person / small team?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you enjoy exploring hand-crafted, pixel art environments?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you like music that's designed to help you focus? (Lo-Fi, etc..)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1619920/extras/ba3e387fd6ee03a09edf6d846a6bfada.avif?t=1743782439\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Thank you so much!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Precision platformer games have always held a special place in my heart, so it\u2019s an incredible honor to contribute to a genre I love through this project.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a solo-developer, all of the support I've received throughout the journey of creating this has meant a lot. Whether you\u2019ve followed the game\u2019s development, helped shape it through testing, or are just now diving in, I\u2019m deeply grateful. Thank you so much! \ud83d\udc99</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1619920/extras/6dfc81e37cf2c9d7bbb0c803dc936840.avif?t=1743782439\" width=600 height=202 /></span></p>","developers":["Shaped by Rain Studios"],"dlc":[3615430],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1619920/header.jpg?t=1743782439","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 Shaped by Rain Studios. All rights reserved. The Path of Ren and its associated logos are trademarks of Shaped by Rain Studios. You are welcome to create and share gameplay content, including monetized videos and streams. However, unauthorized reproduction, distribution, or modification of this game or its assets for use in other commercial products is strictly prohibited.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 18.04+ / SteamOS 3.0 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 / AMD FX-6300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 750 Ti / AMD Radeon HD 7850<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX-compatible or integrated sound card<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> OpenGL 3.2+ / Vulkan</li></ul>","recommend